      "id": 97911,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-30T19:38:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is the characters and extra's unlocked by stertch goals, and scenario's involving them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bsically all the unlocked characters aren't going into the core game, they will go into the expansion, and the more get unlocked, the bigger the expansion.</p><p>But not just unlocked stuff, you will get scenarios, which bring in their own stuff (like minions, or targets, stuff villains bring with them or attack in a scenario) and come with comic-style story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So basivally the stretch goals are determining how awesome the first expansion is going to be, and we are getting that expansion for really cheap.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hopefully we fil that box to the brim with unlocked awesomeness.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:25:24.913Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
